# What never goes into the image build (docker/Dockerfile, built with the repository root as its context). The build
# needs api/, desktop/ and docker/ only; everything here is either another part of the repository or something a
# local checkout holds beside the source: installed packages, build output, databases and receipt files.

.git
.github
.claude
.idea

# Other parts of the repository
site
docs
deploy
*.md

# Installed packages and build output (the image installs and builds its own)
**/node_modules
desktop/dist
desktop/.angular
desktop/coverage
desktop/test-results
desktop/playwright-report
api/api
api/api.exe
api/tmp

# A local run's data: never in an image
**/.env
**/.env.*
/data
/sqlite
api/data
api/sqlite
api/logs
api/temp
**/*.db
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm
**/dump.rdb
